OL,3,GNEWSARussell Brand found guilty of rape
OL,4,Aand three sexual assaults
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe seven charges dated from 1999 to
OL,7,F2009 and concerned six women. They are
OL,8,Fall entitled to lifelong anonymity
OL,10,FIt can now be reported that Brand is
OL,11,Fbeing investigated over further rape
OL,12,Fallegations made by two women
